{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_liganti_diacon-240": "正在从迪亚孔吸收魔力！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_dreiser_charge-241": "德雷福斯开始为法术蓄力！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_enforcer_charge-242": "执行者正在准备强力攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_zedlitz_int-243": "ZEDLITZ: 士兵们，回到侧翼阵地！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_zedlitz_airship-244": "舰队正在准备攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_raven_radiant-245": "冰鸦正在准备毁灭性攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_dewlin_fullmag-246": "满弹匣",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_lanetes_alexSwap-247": "“灵魂之锚”生效，亚历珊德拉无法换回后排！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_palikusCounterStance-248": "PALUKUS: 尽管来打我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_skilirusCounterStance-249": "SKILURUS: 有胆就来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_palikusCounterTaunt-250": "PALUKUS: 来，用你最厉害的招！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-battle_skilirusCounterTaunt-251": "SKILURUS: 怎么，怕了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-golemCountdown-253": "……时间……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-anseitzOfficer-254": "突击队大队长的护盾解除了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-anseitzOfficer-255": "突击队大队长摆好了架势，会反击一切魔法攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-anseitzOfficer-256": "突击队大队长摆好了架势，会反击一切物理攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-anseitzOfficer-257": "突击队大队长收起了反击架势。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-luskyanOfficer_int-258": "Commander: 来人！我需要增援！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-luskyanOfficer_int-259": "Commander: 弟兄们，顶上去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-luskyanOfficer_int-260": "Commander: 全体列阵！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-luskyanOfficer_int-261": "Commander: 列好阵形，弟兄们！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/battleCutscenes/BossCutscenes.yarn-kraptainAI-262": "我先走了！",
  "line:06d883c": "想挑战哪个头目？",
  "line:056226e": "博比",
  "line:0171ca8": "库姆斯",
  "line:0118d9c": "阿平戈里克斯",
  "line:0adede2": "不用，谢谢！",
  "line:0b57520": "JUNA: 你好，我是朱娜。你也许记得我，就是“《Quartet》预告片里的河马”！",
  "line:0ed0685": "JUNA: 不过今天要说清楚，我不是河马，是尤鲁兽。",
  "line:066a81a": "JUNA: 有什么区别？问得好。",
  "line:045585f": "JUNA: 首先，河马大部分时间都泡在水和泥里。",
  "line:04d6eb9": "JUNA: 我也喜欢偶尔去水塘泡泡，可大多时候都待在堤刻以北、风吹过的平原上。",
  "line:04b0f62": "JUNA: 那里秋天很美，真想早点带你去看看。",
  "line:0be2250": "JUNA: 其次，河马大约重三千磅。",
  "line:0d1ed9c": "JUNA: 而我戒掉晚饭后的零食，就瘦到苗条的一千二百磅了。",
  "line:0101d86": "JUNA: 第三，这点再怎么强调都不为过……",
  "line:0951566": "JUNA: 我有智慧，能说人类语言，还能施展强大魔法。",
  "line:0563753": "JUNA: 没错，要火力有火力，要肉也有肉。",
  "line:0e0e800": "JUNA: 不过，这游戏还有许多有意思的主角。",
  "line:07eba5c": "JUNA: 比如我的好朋友亚历珊德拉，天赋过人，自己却好像不知道。",
  "line:0fd03fe": "JUNA: 科黛莉娅就相反，总得提醒大家自己有多聪明。",
  "line:018f0e8": "JUNA: 还有齐卡隆，好像是……装满神秘古老记忆的魔像，之类的？",
  "line:0f4d7b4": "JUNA: 总之，有趣的人多着呢，不只我。",
  "line:04d560d": "JUNA: 看看我们的 Kickstarter 众筹页面，再玩玩三十分钟的试玩版吧！",
  "line:00e3841": "JUNA: 谢谢！",
